        <section class="panel panel-pad fee-card"><div class="trust-card-head"><div><h2>Appointment and kickoff status</h2><p>Readiness stays blocked until all seven gates pass. Revisions preserve every earlier accepted baseline.</p></div><button class="btn ghost" type="button" onclick="refreshProjectKickoff()">Refresh kickoff</button></div><div id="appointmentHistory" class="trust-list"><div class="notice">Loading appointments…</div></div></section>
